#: ../../dev/building.md:1
msgid "Building & Running"
msgstr "ビルドと実行"

#: ../../dev/building.md:3
msgid "Build Commands"
msgstr "ビルドコマンド"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "Command"
msgstr "コマンド"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "Description"
msgstr "説明"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "`./gradlew buildPlugin`"
msgstr "`./gradlew buildPlugin`"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "Build the plugin (includes lexer generation, compilation, packaging)"
msgstr "プラグインのビルド（レクサー生成、コンパイル、パッケージングを含む）"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "`./gradlew clean buildPlugin`"
msgstr "`./gradlew clean buildPlugin`"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "Clean build from scratch"
msgstr "クリーンビルド（ゼロからのビルド）"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "`./gradlew runIde`"
msgstr "`./gradlew runIde`"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "Launch a development IDE instance with the plugin loaded"
msgstr "プラグインを読み込んだ開発用 IDE インスタンスを起動"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "`./gradlew test`"
msgstr "`./gradlew test`"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "Run all tests"
msgstr "すべてのテストを実行"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "`./gradlew ktlintCheck`"
msgstr "`./gradlew ktlintCheck`"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "Run ktlint code style checks"
msgstr "ktlint コードスタイルチェックを実行"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "`./gradlew ktlintFormat`"
msgstr "`./gradlew ktlintFormat`"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "Auto-fix ktlint issues"
msgstr "ktlint の問題を自動修正"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "`./gradlew koverHtmlReport`"
msgstr "`./gradlew koverHtmlReport`"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "Generate HTML code coverage report"
msgstr "HTML コードカバレッジレポートを生成"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "`./gradlew verifyPluginStructure`"
msgstr "`./gradlew verifyPluginStructure`"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "Verify plugin descriptor and structure"
msgstr "プラグインディスクリプタと構造を検証"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "`./gradlew verifyPluginProjectConfiguration`"
msgstr "`./gradlew verifyPluginProjectConfiguration`"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "Verify project configuration"
msgstr "プロジェクト構成を検証"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "`./gradlew verifyPlugin`"
msgstr "`./gradlew verifyPlugin`"

#: ../../dev/building.md
msgid "Verify binary compatibility"
msgstr "バイナリ互換性を検証"

#: ../../dev/building.md:18
msgid "JFlex Lexer Generation"
msgstr "JFlex レクサーの生成"

#: ../../dev/building.md:20
msgid ""
"The JFlex lexer (`RescriptFlexLexer.java`) is auto-generated from "
"`Rescript.flex` during the build:"
msgstr "JFlex レクサー（`RescriptFlexLexer.java`）はビルド時に `Rescript.flex` から自動生成されます:"

#: ../../dev/building.md:22
msgid "**Source:** `src/main/java/com/rescript/plugin/lang/Rescript.flex`"
msgstr "**ソース:** `src/main/java/com/rescript/plugin/lang/Rescript.flex`"

#: ../../dev/building.md:23
msgid ""
"**Generated:** "
"`src/main/java/com/rescript/plugin/lang/RescriptFlexLexer.java`"
msgstr ""
"**生成ファイル:** "
"`src/main/java/com/rescript/plugin/lang/RescriptFlexLexer.java`"

#: ../../dev/building.md:24
msgid "**Gradle task:** `generateRescriptLexer`"
msgstr "**Gradle タスク:** `generateRescriptLexer`"

#: ../../dev/building.md:26
msgid ""
"The `generateRescriptLexer` task is a dependency of `compileJava` and "
"`compileKotlin`, so you never need to run it manually. The generated file"
" is listed in `.gitignore`."
msgstr ""
"`generateRescriptLexer` タスクは `compileJava` と `compileKotlin` "
"の依存タスクであるため、手動で実行する必要はありません。生成ファイルは `.gitignore` に含まれています。"

#: ../../dev/building.md:29
msgid ""
"Never edit `RescriptFlexLexer.java` directly. Always modify "
"`Rescript.flex` and let the build regenerate the Java file."
msgstr ""
"`RescriptFlexLexer.java` を直接編集しないでください。常に `Rescript.flex` を編集し、ビルドで Java "
"ファイルを再生成してください。"

#: ../../dev/building.md:32
msgid "Plugin Packaging"
msgstr "プラグインのパッケージング"

#: ../../dev/building.md:34
msgid "After `./gradlew buildPlugin`, the packaged plugin is at:"
msgstr "`./gradlew buildPlugin` 実行後、パッケージされたプラグインは以下に出力されます:"

#: ../../dev/building.md:40
msgid ""
"This `.zip` can be installed in any compatible JetBrains IDE via "
"**Settings** → **Plugins** → **Install Plugin from Disk**."
msgstr ""
"この `.zip` は、**Settings** → **Plugins** → **Install Plugin from Disk** "
"から互換性のある JetBrains IDE にインストールできます。"

#: ../../dev/building.md:42
msgid "Gradle Configuration"
msgstr "Gradle の設定"

#: ../../dev/building.md:44
msgid "Key configuration files:"
msgstr "主要な設定ファイル:"

#: ../../dev/building.md:28
msgid "File"
msgstr "ファイル"

#: ../../dev/building.md:28
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "用途"

#: ../../dev/building.md:28
msgid "`build.gradle.kts`"
msgstr "`build.gradle.kts`"

#: ../../dev/building.md:28
msgid "Build script (plugins, dependencies, tasks)"
msgstr "ビルドスクリプト（プラグイン、依存関係、タスク）"

#: ../../dev/building.md:28
msgid "`gradle.properties`"
msgstr "`gradle.properties`"

#: ../../dev/building.md:28
msgid "Version numbers, platform settings"
msgstr "バージョン番号、プラットフォーム設定"

#: ../../dev/building.md:28
msgid "`settings.gradle.kts`"
msgstr "`settings.gradle.kts`"

#: ../../dev/building.md:28
msgid "Project name and repository configuration"
msgstr "プロジェクト名とリポジトリの設定"

#: ../../dev/building.md:52
msgid "Platform Version"
msgstr "プラットフォームバージョン"

#: ../../dev/building.md:54
msgid "The target IntelliJ Platform version is configured in `gradle.properties`:"
msgstr "対象の IntelliJ Platform バージョンは `gradle.properties` で設定されています:"

#: ../../dev/building.md:60
msgid ""
"Note: `pluginUntilBuild` is intentionally not set, allowing the plugin to"
" be compatible with all future platform versions."
msgstr ""
"注意: `pluginUntilBuild` は意図的に設定されていません。これにより、プラグインは"
"将来のすべてのプラットフォームバージョンと互換性を持ちます。"

#: ../../dev/building.md:62
msgid "CI Pipeline"
msgstr "CI パイプライン"

#: ../../dev/building.md:64
msgid ""
"The GitHub Actions CI pipeline (`.github/workflows/ci.yml`) runs on every"
" push and PR:"
msgstr "GitHub Actions CI パイプライン（`.github/workflows/ci.yml`）はすべてのプッシュと PR で実行されます:"

#: ../../dev/building.md:66
msgid "actionlint — Validate GitHub Actions workflow files"
msgstr "actionlint — GitHub Actions ワークフローファイルの検証"

#: ../../dev/building.md:67
msgid "ktlint — Code style checks"
msgstr "ktlint — コードスタイルチェック"

#: ../../dev/building.md:68
msgid "Build — Compile and package"
msgstr "Build — コンパイルとパッケージング"

#: ../../dev/building.md:69
msgid "Test — Run tests with coverage (Kover)"
msgstr "Test — カバレッジ付きテスト実行（Kover）"

#: ../../dev/building.md:70
msgid "Verify — Plugin structure and binary compatibility (push only)"
msgstr "Verify — プラグイン構造とバイナリ互換性の検証（プッシュ時のみ）"

